      "message": "Could we use `sfdp_normalise_ip4_key()` here, and the IPv6 equivalent below, as the API dump does? `session-\u003ekeys[0]` is stored in canonical low/high order; when `pseudo_dir` is set, these fields reverse the real source and destination while the forward/reverse counters retain their original direction.",
      "revId": "67d00741edcb696d9fd146d418ba251d652e0f31",
